    values:originalText "(3) This Part applies to a service if:  (a) it is a service for carrying communications, or enabling communications to be carried, by means of guided or unguided electromagnetic energy or both; and  (b) it is a service:  (i) operated by a carrier; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Data retention  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (ii) operated by an internet service provider (within the meaning of Schedule 5 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992); or  (iii) of a kind for which a declaration under subsection (3A) is in force; and  (c) the person operating the service owns or operates, in Australia, infrastructure that enables the provision of any of its relevant services; but does not apply to a broadcasting service (within the meaning of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) This Part applies to a service if:  (a) it is a service for carrying communications, or enabling communications to be carried, by means of guided or unguided electromagnetic energy or both; and  (b) it is a service:  (i) operated by a carrier; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Data retention  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (ii) operated by an internet service provider (within the meaning of Schedule 5 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992); or  (iii) of a kind for which a declaration under subsection (3A) is in force; and  (c) the person operating the service owns or operates, in Australia, infrastructure that enables the provision of any of its relevant services; but does not apply to a broadcasting service (within the meaning of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eeb5e770a9df2b43a963f10e10f21f55bfd525a40f74483fcd33bc57685bf1ef" ;
