concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187a-ss-3b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187A(3B) Service providers must keep certain information and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187a-ss-3b ;
    values:originalText "(3B) A declaration under subsection (3A):  (a) comes into force when it is made, or on such later day as is specified in the declaration; and  (b) ceases to be in force at the end of the period of 40 sitting days of a House of the Parliament after the declaration comes into force." ;
    skos:definition "(3B) A declaration under subsection (3A):  (a) comes into force when it is made, or on such later day as is specified in the declaration; and  (b) ceases to be in force at the end of the period of 40 sitting days of a House of the Parliament after the declaration comes into force."@en ;
