doc:sch-1-sec-187a-ss-3c a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187A(3C) Service providers must keep certain information and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3C) If a Bill is introduced into either House of the Parliament that includes an amendment of subsection (3), the Minister:  (a) must refer the amendment to the Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and Security for review; and  (b) must not in that referral specify, as the period within which the Committee is to report on its review, a period that will end earlier than 15 sitting days of a House of the Parliament after the introduction of the Bill." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187A(4) Service providers must keep certain information and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to be kept:  (a) information that is the contents or substance of a communication; or Note: This paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not required to keep information about telecommunications content.  (b) information that:  (i) states an address to which a communication was sent on the internet, from a telecommunications device, using ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention" ;
    skos:definition "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to be kept:  (a) information that is the contents or substance of a communication; or Note: This paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not required to keep information about telecommunications content.  (b) information that:  (i) states an address to which a communication was sent on the internet, from a telecommunications device, using ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "08ad15588978f93456b5fa12273e89f2249db789b6b1590aa90fdf2f1b43e688" ;
