doc:sch-1-sec-187ba a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187BA Ensuring the confidentiality of information" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A service provider must protect the confidentiality of information that, or information in a document that, the service provider must keep, or cause to be kept, under section 187A by:  (a) encrypting the information; and  (b) protecting the information from unauthorised interference or unauthorised access." ;
