doc:sch-1-sec-187g-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187G(3) Consultation with agencies and the ACMA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The service provider must respond to a request for an amendment of the original plan either:  (a) by indicating its acceptance of the request, by amending the original plan appropriately and by giving the amended plan to the Communications Access Co-ordinator within the response period; or  (b) by indicating that it does not accept the request and providing its reasons for that non-acceptance. The ACMA’s role" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187g-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187G(4) Consultation with agencies and the ACMA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187g-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the service provider indicates that it does not accept a request for an amendment of the original plan, the Communications Access Co-ordinator must:  (a) refer the request and the service provider’s response to the ACMA; and  (b) request the ACMA to determine whether any amendment of the original plan is required." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the service provider indicates that it does not accept a request for an amendment of the original plan, the Communications Access Co-ordinator must:  (a) refer the request and the service provider’s response to the ACMA; and  (b) request the ACMA to determine whether any amendment of the original plan is required."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9742514fce74b24f27ab21f697ecb89077f96d30e21907eee1e5a185caff5eee" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187g ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must refer request and response to ACMA, and request ACMA's determination on amendment." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf> ;
