doc:sch-1-sec-187g-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187G(6) Consultation with agencies and the ACMA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) The Communications Access Co-ordinator must:  (a) if, on receipt of a determination under paragraph (5)(b), the service provider amends the original plan to take account of that determination and gives the amended plan to the Communications Access Co-ordinator—approve the plan as amended, and notify the service provider of the approval; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention" ;
