doc:sch-1-sec-187la-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "187LA(1) Application of the Privacy Act 1988" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Privacy Act 1988 applies in relation to a service provider, as if the service provider were an organisation within the meaning of that Act, to the extent that the activities of the service provider relate to retained data." ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187la-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187LA(2) Application of the Privacy Act 1988"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187la-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Information that is kept under this Part, or information that is in a document kept under this Part is taken, for the purposes of the Privacy Act 1988, to be personal information about an individual if the information relates to:  (a) the individual; or  (b) a communication to which the individual is a party." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Information that is kept under this Part, or information that is in a document kept under this Part is taken, for the purposes of the Privacy Act 1988, to be personal information about an individual if the information relates to:  (a) the individual; or  (b) a communication to which the individual is a party."@en ;
