concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187N(3) Review of operation of Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187n-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Until the review is completed, the head (however described) of an enforcement agency must keep:  (a) all of the documents that he or she is required to retain under section 185; and  (b) all of the information that he or she is required, by paragraphs 186(1)(e) to (k), to include in a report under subsection 186(1); relating to the period starting on the commencement of this Part and ending when the review is completed." ;
