concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187P Annual reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-187p ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause to be prepared a written report on the operation of this Part during the year ending on that 30 June.  (1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under subsection (1), it must include information about:  (a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part; and  (b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved under Division 2 of this Part.  (2) A report under subsection (1) must be included in the report prepared under subsection 186(2) relating to the year ending on that 30 June.  (3) A report under subsection (1) must not be made in a manner that is likely to enable the identification of a person. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause to be prepared a written report on the operation of this Part during the year ending on that 30 June.  (1A) Without limiting the matters that may be included in a report under subsection (1), it must include information about:  (a) the costs to service providers of complying with this Part; and  (b) the use of data retention implementation plans approved under Division 2 of this Part.  (2) A report under subsection (1) must be included in the report prepared under subsection 186(2) relating to the year ending on that 30 June.  (3) A report under subsection (1) must not be made in a manner that is likely to enable the identification of a person. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c1c7b238c64bd41c963c72d61124ffc89478133953f1975c008516464c339ea7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-187p-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
