doc:sch-1-sec-1h a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1H Subsection 6(1) (at the end of the definition of personal" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "information) Add: Note: Section 187LA of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 extends the meaning of personal information to cover information kept under Part 5-1A of that Act." ;
