concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Subsection 105(5A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (5A) The ACMA must monitor, and report each financial year to the Minister on:  (a) the operation of Part 14 and on the costs of compliance with the requirements of that Part; and  (b) without limiting paragraph (a), the costs of compliance with the requirements of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 (about data retention)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (5A) The ACMA must monitor, and report each financial year to the Minister on:  (a) the operation of Part 14 and on the costs of compliance with the requirements of that Part; and  (b) without limiting paragraph (a), the costs of compliance with the requirements of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 (about data retention)."@en ;
