concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3A After subsection 280(1A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3a ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1B) Subject to subsection (1C), paragraph (1)(b) does not apply to a disclosure of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is required or authorised because of:  (i) a subpoena; or  (ii) a notice of disclosure; or  (iii) an order of a court;  in connection with a civil proceeding; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1B) Subject to subsection (1C), paragraph (1)(b) does not apply to a disclosure of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is required or authorised because of:  (i) a subpoena; or  (ii) a notice of disclosure; or  (iii) an order of a court;  in connection with a civil proceeding; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention"@en ;
