concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-6dc-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6DC(3) Part 4-1 issuing authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6dc-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person’s appointment ceases to have effect if:  (a) the person ceases to be a person whom the Minister could appoint under this section; or  (b) the Minister, by writing, revokes the appointment." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person’s appointment ceases to have effect if:  (a) the person ceases to be a person whom the Minister could appoint under this section; or  (b) the Minister, by writing, revokes the appointment."@en ;
