concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-180j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180J Requesting a journalist information warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-180j ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Director-General of Security may request the Minister to issue a journalist information warrant in relation to a particular person.  (2) The request must specify the facts and other grounds on which the Director-General considers it necessary that the warrant be issued." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Director-General of Security may request the Minister to issue a journalist information warrant in relation to a particular person.  (2) The request must specify the facts and other grounds on which the Director-General considers it necessary that the warrant be issued."@en ;
