    cof:title "180J Requesting a journalist information warrant" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Director-General of Security may request the Minister to issue a journalist information warrant in relation to a particular person.  (2) The request must specify the facts and other grounds on which the Director-General considers it necessary that the warrant be issued." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

