concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-180k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180K Further information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-180k ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may require the Director-General of Security to give to the Minister, within the period specified in the requirement, further information in connection with a request under this Subdivision.  (2) If the Director-General breaches the requirement, the Minister may:  (a) refuse to consider the request; or  (b) refuse to take any action, or any further action, in relation to the request." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may require the Director-General of Security to give to the Minister, within the period specified in the requirement, further information in connection with a request under this Subdivision.  (2) If the Director-General breaches the requirement, the Minister may:  (a) refuse to consider the request; or  (b) refuse to take any action, or any further action, in relation to the request."@en ;
