    skos:definition "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person discloses or uses a document; and  (b) the document consists (wholly or partly) of any of the following:  (i) a journalist information warrant (other than such a warrant that relates only to section 178A);  (ii) the revocation of such a warrant. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 1  Data retention"@en ;
