concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Applications made before commencement of Part 5-1A"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) At any time after this Act receives the Royal Assent, a service provider may apply for either or both of the following:  (a) approval of:  (i) a data retention implementation plan; or  (ii) an amendment of a data retention implementation plan; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Data retention  Schedule 1 Application provisions  Part 3  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  under Division 2 of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act;  (b) a decision under subsection 187K(1) or 187KA(2) of that Act as so amended. (2) Paragraph (1)(a) of this item does not apply to an application for approval of a data retention implementation plan unless the application would, if made after the commencement of Part 5-1A of that Act as so amended, have complied with section 187E of that Act as so amended." ;
    skos:definition "(1) At any time after this Act receives the Royal Assent, a service provider may apply for either or both of the following:  (a) approval of:  (i) a data retention implementation plan; or  (ii) an amendment of a data retention implementation plan; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Data retention  Schedule 1 Application provisions  Part 3  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  under Division 2 of Part 5-1A of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act;  (b) a decision under subsection 187K(1) or 187KA(2) of that Act as so amended. (2) Paragraph (1)(a) of this item does not apply to an application for approval of a data retention implementation plan unless the application would, if made after the commencement of Part 5-1A of that Act as so amended, have complied with section 187E of that Act as so amended."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9dcd8ef1077b205e0d25241e194afab88029273d520b6c89ef511231b4469dda" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Service provider may apply for approval of data retention implementation plan or amendment." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf> ;
