concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "176A(3) Meaning of enforcement agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-176a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:  (a) an authority or body to be an enforcement agency; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data  Schedule 2 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (b) persons specified, or of a kind specified, in the declaration to be officers of the enforcement agency for the purposes of this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:  (a) an authority or body to be an enforcement agency; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data  Schedule 2 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (b) persons specified, or of a kind specified, in the declaration to be officers of the enforcement agency for the purposes of this Act."@en ;
