    values:originalText "If:  (a) a stored communications warrant was issued to an authority or body before the commencement of this Schedule; and  (b) the warrant was in force immediately before that commencement; and  (c) on that commencement, the authority or body is not a criminal law-enforcement agency (whether or not it is an enforcement agency); after that commencement, the warrant continues in force, and Chapter 3 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act continues to apply in relation to the warrant, as if the authority or body were a criminal law-enforcement agency." ;
