concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-2-sec-50 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "50 Existing authorisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-50 ;
    values:originalText "If:  (a) an authority or body made an authorisation under Division 4 of Part 4-1 of the Telecommunications (Interception and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data  Schedule 2 Application provisions  Part 3  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  Access) Act 1979 before the commencement of this Schedule; and  (b) the authorisation was in force immediately before that commencement; and  (c) on that commencement, the authority or body is not an enforcement agency; after that commencement, the authorisation continues in force, and Chapter 4 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act continues to apply in relation to the authorisation, as if the authority or body were an enforcement agency." ;
    skos:definition "If:  (a) an authority or body made an authorisation under Division 4 of Part 4-1 of the Telecommunications (Interception and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Restricting access to stored communications and telecommunications data  Schedule 2 Application provisions  Part 3  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  Access) Act 1979 before the commencement of this Schedule; and  (b) the authorisation was in force immediately before that commencement; and  (c) on that commencement, the authority or body is not an enforcement agency; after that commencement, the authorisation continues in force, and Chapter 4 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 as amended by this Act continues to apply in relation to the authorisation, as if the authority or body were an enforcement agency."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd26fa278db01b5ac3bb0f403b755969282cffd2431d1eff5775f6a3c381d319" ;
    cof:pageNumber "74"^^xsd:integer ;
