concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186b-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186B(6) Inspection of records"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-186b-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:  (a) a stored communications warrant; or  (b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1; the Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the agency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of the warrant or authorisation." ;
    skos:definition "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:  (a) a stored communications warrant; or  (b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1; the Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the agency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of the warrant or authorisation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78fb21cc6503b0ca8a108e2b01adc36cf75310c5b7cac879c2893fa6b60d00bc" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186b ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting records under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
