concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186C Power to obtain relevant information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-186c ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Ombudsman has reasonable grounds to believe that an officer of a particular enforcement agency is able to give information relevant to an inspection under this Chapter of the agency’s records, the Ombudsman may: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Ombudsman has reasonable grounds to believe that an officer of a particular enforcement agency is able to give information relevant to an inspection under this Chapter of the agency’s records, the Ombudsman may: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "62d242e4b56017755f8eb9d1f5da4f41c3586b9cfecf20029a902f9e84c97f25" ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ombudsman may obtain relevant information from an officer of a particular enforcement agency." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015.pdf> ;
