concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186E Application of Ombudsman Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-186e ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 11A of the Ombudsman Act 1976 does not apply in relation to the exercise or proposed exercise of a power, or the performance or the proposed performance of a function, of the Ombudsman under this Chapter.  (2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the Ombudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything that an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this Chapter. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 11A of the Ombudsman Act 1976 does not apply in relation to the exercise or proposed exercise of a power, or the performance or the proposed performance of a function, of the Ombudsman under this Chapter.  (2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the Ombudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything that an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this Chapter. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "573855a39fc076b51f77b5960e9307b1b34930b88faf0f111f3f4f16731f5de1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186e-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186e-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
