concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186G Delegation by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-186g ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman may delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person; all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Chapter other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Ombudsman may delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 39, 2015 Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person; all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Chapter other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "97afd8c63eddcbfb4b8541e452c77e1babb9cfd285a815cec001a0702e1ef4ef" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186g-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186g-ss-2 ;
