concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186J(5) Reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of an enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the Ombudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a report on the contravention. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of an enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the Ombudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a report on the contravention. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4e6a57fd91346e15f04e3fd6d6e6ae21ce9b74460ac23c7a32f895392dec7e3b" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-amendment-data-retention-act-2015-sch-3-sec-186j ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ombudsman may include report on contravention in inspection report." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
