doc:sch-3-sec-186j-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "186J(5) Reports" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of an enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the Ombudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a report on the contravention. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00039  Schedule 3  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman" ;
